.*
.* WRKSPLFA: one spooled file's attributes, over pages; F5 reads them
.* again.
:PNLGRP.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=VALCL BASETYPE='CHAR 20'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=TEXTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 30'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=FILE CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=JOB CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=USER CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=NUMBER CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=SPLNBR CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=CRTDATE CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=CRTTIME CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=STATUS CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=OUTQ CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=OUTQLIB CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DEVICE CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=OUTPTY CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=PAGES CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=CURPAGE CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=COPIES CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=COPIESLEFT CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=FORMTYPE CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=USRDTA CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=SAVE CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=SCHEDULE CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=RECORDS CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=PRTF CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DEVTYPE CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=PAGESIZE CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=LPI CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=CPI CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=OVRFLW CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=EXPDATE CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=USRDFNDTA CLASS=TEXTCL.
:KEYL NAME=SAKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F5 ACTION='RETURN 5'.F5=Refresh
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=WRKSPLFA KEYL=SAKEYS HELP=WRKSPLFA ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SPACE.Work with Spooled File Attributes
:DATA DEPTH=4 COMPACT.
:DATAI VAR=JOB USAGE=OUTPUT.Job
:DATAI VAR=USER USAGE=OUTPUT.User
:DATAI VAR=NUMBER USAGE=OUTPUT.Number
:DATAI VAR=FILE USAGE=OUTPUT.File
:EDATA.
:DATA DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES.
:DATAI VAR=SPLNBR USAGE=OUTPUT.Spooled file number
:DATAI VAR=CRTDATE USAGE=OUTPUT.Date file opened
:DATAI VAR=CRTTIME USAGE=OUTPUT.Time file opened
:DATAI VAR=STATUS USAGE=OUTPUT.Status
:DATAI VAR=OUTQ USAGE=OUTPUT.Output queue
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAI VAR=OUTQLIB USAGE=OUTPUT.Library
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI VAR=DEVICE USAGE=OUTPUT.Device or writer printing it
:DATAI VAR=OUTPTY USAGE=OUTPUT.Output priority
:DATAI VAR=PAGES USAGE=OUTPUT.Total pages
:DATAI VAR=CURPAGE USAGE=OUTPUT.Current page
:DATAI VAR=COPIES USAGE=OUTPUT.Copies
:DATAI VAR=COPIESLEFT USAGE=OUTPUT.Copies left to print
:DATAI VAR=FORMTYPE USAGE=OUTPUT.Form type
:DATAI VAR=USRDTA USAGE=OUTPUT.User data
:DATAI VAR=SAVE USAGE=OUTPUT.Save file
:DATAI VAR=SCHEDULE USAGE=OUTPUT.Spooled output schedule
:DATAI VAR=RECORDS USAGE=OUTPUT.Records
:DATAI VAR=PRTF USAGE=OUTPUT.Printer file
:DATAI VAR=DEVTYPE USAGE=OUTPUT.Printer device type
:DATAI VAR=PAGESIZE USAGE=OUTPUT.Page size, lines by positions
:DATAI VAR=LPI USAGE=OUTPUT.Lines per inch
:DATAI VAR=CPI USAGE=OUTPUT.Characters per inch
:DATAI VAR=OVRFLW USAGE=OUTPUT.Overflow line number
:DATAI VAR=EXPDATE USAGE=OUTPUT.Expiration date
:DATAI VAR=USRDFNDTA USAGE=OUTPUT.User defined data
:EDATA.
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=WRKSPLFA.Work with Spooled File Attributes - Help
:P.What the system keeps about one spooled file: the job that made it
and when, where it waits and who prints it, its pages and copies, and
how its pages are laid out. F5 reads them again; CHGSPLFA changes
them.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
